Modifications
-------------
This program has been modified. The modifications include, non-exhaustively:

  * rebranding: the product is called "NERV Desk", the executable is
    nervdesk.exe and the machine identifier is "nervdesk" (the SCM service
    name). Part of the payload deliberately keeps its upstream file name,
    for example librustdesk.dll and the RustDeskPrinterDriver driver files;
  * an own Windows installer (res/msi, WiX v4) with native custom actions,
    including taking over the legacy "RustDesk" service name and stopping or
    deleting only services whose binary path is one of ours;
  * Windows platform changes: the legacy service takeover and its log,
    ISO-8601 timestamps in that log, and literal substring matching in the
    service path probes;
  * an own MSVC cross-compilation path and replacement of several vendored
    native dependencies;
  * the privacy statement shown by the installer was rewritten for this fork
    (res/msi/Package/License.rtf);
  * product names and identifiers in the installer, in the tray and in the
    desktop application.

Dates of modification: the modifications were made in 2026; the rebranding
change is commit 92e3f19fb of 2026-10-01. Every distributed binary also
embeds the date of the build it came from. This NOTICE was last updated on
2026-10-03.

